B.Q7=new A.a2("Search and open","Type English or Mongolian in the large search box. Tap a result to read its English definition and Book example. Tap a linked word or Connected terms to explore related meanings; All connected terms expands the list. Choose the intended meaning when offered alternatives. \xd7 clears the search; Back returns to the previous page.")
B.Q1=new A.a2("Speak and listen",u.a)
B.Qk=new A.a2("Favorites and saved translations","Tap the star on an entry to add or remove a Favorite. Open \u2630 \u2192 Favorites to retrieve it. Open Notes to write personal notes, then Save notes; Save Translation stores a personally checked translation after \u201cI checked it \u2014 save\u201d; Save new version keeps an updated copy. The bookmarks button opens Saved Translations; Remove deletes only that saved translation after confirmation. These records stay on this device; do not uninstall or clear app data to keep them.")
B.Q8=new A.a2("Correct, Remember and Forget","After MN voice search, tap Correct voice result, choose the intended entry and tap Remember. A matching correction can be opened or searched; Forget removes that correction. Confirm \u201cDid you mean\u2026\u201d suggestions before searching. Corrections help this app on this phone; they do not retrain the speech engine or verify a translation.")
B.QA=new A.a2("Offline and Online","The dictionary, local bilingual searches, Favorites, notes and saved translations work offline. Online translation is optional and off by default. Tap Online after entering Mongolian text; allow it when prompted, or enable it in \u2630 \u2192 Privacy & online translation; it sends Mongolian search text to MyMemory. It is a fallback, so known local terms still search offline. A provider may return no useful match, reject a request or time out. Do not send confidential information. Turn it off in the same menu.")
B.Qa=new A.a2("Supporting Resources and internet","Use Supporting Resources for the reference list. App help opens instructions and technical help. Tap a named source button at the end of a definition to open its supporting webpage. Sources and online translation need internet. Android normally prefers working Wi-Fi; otherwise it may use mobile data according to your settings. Mobile data charges may apply. For Wi-Fi only, turn mobile data off in phone settings. A source can support a translation or legal context without certifying every word. Pending review is not professor verification.")
B.Qi=new A.a2("Navigation and help","\u2630 opens chapters, Favorites, this guide and privacy settings. The book button opens About / Introduction. START opens these English and Mongolian instructions before the introduction; returning readers can use SKIP THIS. Browse all chapters opens the chapter list; Return to search returns to searching. Close dismisses a panel; Cancel leaves the action unconfirmed. Retry repeats an unavailable operation. Save confirmations and error messages tell you whether an action succeeded.")
B.JR=s([B.Q7,B.Q1,B.Qk,B.Q8,B.QA,B.Qa,B.Qi],t.Wy)
